AGENT: CustomerSupport
STEP
name=GreetCustomer
prompt=Welcome the customer and ask them to describe their issue.
systemPrompt=You are a customer support agent. Be polite and professional.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=CategorizeIssue
prompt=Identify the category of the customer's issue: billing, technical, or shipping.
systemPrompt=You are a customer support agent. Accurately classify the issue type.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=CheckOrderStatus
prompt=Look up the customer's order or account status based on their provided ID.
systemPrompt=You are a customer support agent. Retrieve accurate account information.
output=BOOLEAN
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=ProposeResolution
prompt=Suggest an appropriate resolution based on the issue category and order status.
systemPrompt=You are a customer support agent. Offer fair and practical solutions.
output=STRING
ENDSTEP
STEP
name=CollectSatisfactionScore
prompt=Ask the customer to rate their satisfaction with the support on a scale of 1 to 5.
systemPrompt=You are a customer support agent. Collect feedback professionally.
output=INT
ENDSTEP
